($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16632914, $f$Beauty and the Millionaire$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanondolce$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The last thing Wei WuXian had been expecting to happen that evening was getting tied up, kidnapped, and thrown on the front porch of some snobby rich kid's Manor, but life has ways of suprsing you like that sometimes.Or, alternatively: everybody is born with their soulmate's name tattoed on their wrist, and Lan WangJi is an impatient man.$f$, 10411, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:55:27.287+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:55:27.304+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
