($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16767547, $f$A Day in Yunmeng$f$, ARRAY[$f$Suspicious_Popsicle$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A few weeks after Wei WuXian returned from the Burial Mounds, on a rare day when his shidi was not around to shove his blinding desire for revenge between them, Wei WuXian had followed Lan WangJi back to an inn to talk. The conversation had grown heated. Liquor had been involved. Their relationship had changed.
