($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16907397, $f$Jiang Cheng Is Done$f$, ARRAY[$f$daiki$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$a crack modern AU where everyone is alive and happy except for Jiang Cheng because he doesn't know what he's done to deserve to be saddled as Wei Wuxian's best friend; aka MXY and WWX as twins, everyone thirsts for NMJ, WangXian as kings of PDA, and Jiang Cheng is done$f$, 5053, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:54:48.937+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:54:48.996+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16921137, $f$As Pure As Snow$f$, ARRAY[$f$Shinocchi$f$, $f$FreeMindandSoul$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei WuXian and Lan WangJi spend their winter days in a place Wei WuXian never expected. But that's fine, Wei WuXian too has hidden away a surprise to return Lan WangJi's favor -- something that will change their relationship forever.Even in the coldest days, one only needs someone that matters to give them the best warmth they need.[Vietnamese version]$f$, 25480, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-28T14:30:45.927+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-28T14:30:45.973+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16946640, $f$snowflakes$f$, ARRAY[$f$domokunrainbowkinz$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The first rule of his clan was the most important one, to never be broken: never interact with humans.Despite this, Lan Zhan couldn't just leave this shivering boy to die.$f$, 9212, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:49:03.728+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:49:03.767+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16985823, $f$Overcover$f$, ARRAY[$f$vanerz$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 20978, 6, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-12-13T14:50:18.270+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-13T14:50:18.308+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17003142, $f$Diablerie$f$, ARRAY[$f$willowcatkin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$They’re sitting in the Library Pavilion: as usual Lan WangJi is quietly copying ancient texts—the fluid movement of his brush practiced and graceful. His hair is neatly tied in his hair ornament and the rest of it lies glossy and straight on his back. Wei WuXian is sprawled inelegantly across from him, his head resting on the table, doodling drawings of bunnies. Daemon AU$f$, 7061, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:47:12.330+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:47:12.355+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17019378, $f$Voice of Reason (Tell Me Another One)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Prinzenhasserin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jean doesn't like it when Locke flirts with red-headed women, and he likes it even less when it leads to Locke being injured.$f$, 3662, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:20:57.933+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:20:58.079+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17026398, $f$all it does is rain$f$, ARRAY[$f$silveronthetree$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Archie Curtis is urgently summoned to a house party by his uncle, the explorer Sir Henry Curtis, he's rather reluctant to attend. He's still recovering from his last rather terrible experience at a house party, and he hasn't seen Daniel for weeks. 
Featuring science, mystery and some terrible weather, this house party doesn't turn out to be quite as bad as the last one$f$, 7456, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-02-27T03:07:31.411+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-27T03:07:31.603+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17038961, $f$madness be my mercy$f$, ARRAY[$f$bluebeholder$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“If I am mad, it is mercy! May the gods pity the man who in his callousness can remain sane to the hideous end!”― H.P. Lovecraft, "The Temple"Dunwall is crumbling. Jessamine is dead and Emily is lost. Corvo needs something, anything, to cling to as the world descends into madness.The Outsider is that something.$f$, 1145, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-07-13T16:26:30.785+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-13T16:26:30.897+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17043503, $f$A Twelve Days' Mystery$f$, ARRAY[$f$El Staplador (elstaplador)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Alpennia Series - Heather Rose Jones$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Christmas 1824, and the twelve days of festivities ought to be a period of frivolity and respite for everyone who isn't expected to be at the New Year's court, and even for those who are. But that was before someone from Jeanne's past reappeared... with a problem.$f$, 7413, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-04-26T01:00:52.775+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-26T01:00:52.777+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17044670, $f$A Taste of Honey$f$, ARRAY[$f$amusedrhyme (lazarus_girl)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Valerie and Lucille are just friends, until a summer day trip to Wanstead Park changes what being friends really means. In the aftermath, Valerie questions everything, unsure if she’s brave enough to seek out the answers from Lucille.
  “In saying nothing, she said everything.”$f$, 9101, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-03T23:23:18.277+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-03T23:23:18.278+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17051696, $f$elegy of the celestial crane$f$, ARRAY[$f$inberin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$two lonely souls find each other, but this isn't their story.$f$, 44380, 2, 2, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-05T06:58:46.588+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-05T06:58:46.732+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17052776, $f$I WILL NOT BOW$f$, ARRAY[$f$AngelaVargas$f$, $f$AngeloVargas$f$, $f$FongLian$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$How long can a Promise be held to be fulfilled when nobody would trust that you could, YinLing an Angel born with Natural Black Wings and the Sole Ferryman of the Soul to the Angelic Realm, befriended Yàdāng and Xiàwá the Two Great Angels, Especially Xiàwá. Xiàwá who loves humans the most made him Promise to protect Humanity on her last breath. But with Danger Lurking in every corner, can YinLing keep his Promise? Or not?$f$, 8124, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:43.500+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:43.515+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17057957, $f$A Song Of Storm And Fire$f$, ARRAY[$f$HikariNoHimeWriter$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He still couldn’t understand why everything have gone so wrong. Was Fate enjoying playing around with him this badly? Didn’t They have enough already?...Lan Zhan was gone.And Wei Ying was once again left all alone.This time, forever.$f$, 68492, 13, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-23T13:25:44.665+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T13:25:44.692+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17060159, $f$White Copper$f$, ARRAY[$f$UrsulaKohl$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Alpennia Series - Heather Rose Jones$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the alchemists' lore, the element of copper corresponds to Venus. Antuniet and Jeanne are studying the properties of a more complex alloy.$f$, 1706, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-04-26T00:59:11.338+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-26T00:59:11.340+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17108978, $f$wei ying's big day (not really)$f$, ARRAY[$f$keiyoko$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$on the eve of his wedding, wei wuxian goes out for drinks and comes home blackout drunk.  the next day, he's dead to the world and nothing mo xuanyu does can wake his twin.  the solution?mo xuanyu pretends to be his brother.$f$, 4569, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:47:00.334+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:47:00.359+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17127089, $f$Marked$f$, ARRAY[$f$EllaStorm$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ever since he has been drawn into the Void for the first time, Corvo Attano feels - watched. And for good reason, it turns out, when a notorious deity with inscrutable motivations shows up in his bedroom one night…$f$, 1905, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-05-27T13:52:26.050+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-27T13:52:26.473+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17128100, $f$A Different Dream$f$, ARRAY[$f$tinybluepixel$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 9444, 2, NULL, false, 3, false, $f$2019-06-29T00:05:30.523+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T00:05:30.636+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17180753, $f$The Horse-Master of Lanling Jin$f$, ARRAY[$f$Einhorn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jin Fengqi is used to things going not quite right, or not going right at all.You have to be, when it comes to the business of horses—hundreds of them, in fact. Not a day goes by where he is not reminded of life’s unpredictable nature, whether it be by the sudden injury of a horse in a safe paddock or the appearance of a very scruffy young disciple in the hayloft.$f$, 3797, 1, 2, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:14:22.344+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:14:22.384+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
