($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17377547, $f$As My Tongue Thickens and a Subtle Fire$f$, ARRAY[$f$greyskais$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“I dare Wei Wuxian to give Lan Wangji a lap dance!”Wei Wuxian can’t help but meet Lan Wangji’s eyes. They’re like two luminous chips of gold, clear and glinting despite the dimness of the lights. Wei Wuxian feels an unfamiliar twinge. Well, he knows the second Lan doesn’t like him that much, but he has to carry through, doesn’t he? Wei Wuxian gets to his feet rather unsteadily, forcing a smirk onto his lips. “Well, the rules are the rules, aren’t they?”$f$, 10079, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:54:16.999+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:54:17.024+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
