($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17419853, $f$two boys talk in a library$f$, ARRAY[$f$exocara$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xue Yang meets Mo Xuanyu in a small corner of Lanling Jin Sect’s library, hidden away from everyone else. The afternoon sun shines in through the window, enveloping the boy in a soft, warm glow.$f$, 3924, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:37:36.109+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:37:36.136+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17434079, $f$Rum and Hot Chocolate$f$, ARRAY[$f$multifanwho$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Having rum laced hot chocolate is starting to become a regular event for Val and Lucille at the end of long days. It's an unspoken rule between everyone at Nonnatus that the pair get to be alone, considering how close the two have gotten. Phyllis has seen this process before, so she knows how precious those moments alone can be.Uuuuh yeah I just read over it and it's pure trash, read at your own will$f$, 747, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-01T20:30:33.224+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T20:30:33.225+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17435864, $f$Unexpected$f$, ARRAY[$f$nanodayolo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When the Lanling Jin sect runs into financial trouble, a marriage between the third son of LanlingJin, Mo Xuanyu, and the Second Jade of Lan, Lan Wangji is arranged. But before the two can even meet, Mo Xuanyu is kidnapped.Wei Wuxian has to pretend to be Mo Xuanyu, all while spending time with Lan Wangji, while Mo Xuanyu tries to find his way back home with the help of the street smart Xue Yang.None of them could have possibly foreseen the outcome.$f$, 68201, 22, 22, true, 1, false, $f$2019-12-02T04:26:12.272+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-02T04:26:12.303+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
