($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17442254, $f$The Start of a Living Nightmare$f$, ARRAY[$f$silverneko (silver_neko)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After the Sunshot Campaign, Jin Guang Shan tries to live as usual as the new head of the cultivation sects. However, unknown to the rest of the world, old ties aren't buried so easily and his past haunts him day and night.Just some fantasizing and its the Jin's turn to shine.Prologue in A Shower of Golden Feathers.$f$, 2111, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:43:20.293+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:43:20.319+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
