($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17501978, $f$The Seven Writers$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Seven people were caught by a mysterious, powerful and perverted creature and send into a place where they assumed that was inside IT. Wei Wuxian, Lan Wangji, Lan Xichen, Jiang Cheng, Jin Ling, Lan Sizhui and Lan JingYi's only way of escaping is to write erotic stories between themselves. Who with who will pair? How many legs are going to be broken? Will they have the courage to look each other in the eyes after that? Who knows.$f$, 13602, 7, 7, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:39:16.504+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:39:16.530+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
