($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17545169, $f$Where the Sun rises$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanjingyeets$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$«A trip?,» Lan Wangji asked, turning his head. Wei Wuxian kissed his chin. «Yes. For your birthday.»«And where will you take me?»Wei Wuxian’s eyes shone brightly, the light of dawn painting them gold. «Wherever my husband will want to go.»Lan Wangji kissed him again, bringing a hand to his neck. Wei Wuxian still had his hair loose, the red ribbon he regularly used wrapped around the alpha’s wrist. While pushing a strand of hair from his face, Lan Wangji thought he was beautiful.«Take me where the sun rises,» he murmured, making the alpha laugh. «You want me to take you to the East? To the sea? Fine, fine, I will! I will take my Lan Zhan to the moon if you asked!»«Not the moon,» Lan Wangji replied softly, and caressed his cheek. «Just the sea will be enough.»$f$, 8121, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:26.139+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:26.154+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17548754, $f$Rosencrantz and Guildenstern Are Dead, Right?$f$, ARRAY[$f$The_Supervillains_Goatee$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngshiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$人渣反派自救系统$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$Heaven Official's Blessing$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Luo Binghe: In 10 years, I guarantee I’ll be Shizun’s second husband.
Mobei Jun: What happened to the first?
Luo Binghe: Nothing you can prove.
(Thank you, Incorrect Scum Villain Quotes!)$f$, 12486, 12, 12, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:50:55.648+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:50:55.681+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17560847, $f$Haunted Tales of Papapa$f$, ARRAY[$f$yumette$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mysterious ghost stories circulate the human realm. Some of which are downright frightening. But in reality, the truth behind all of these stories is the same: a night of intense passion between Xie Lian and Hua Cheng.Please assume that all of this takes place after the novel (main story + extras) so there is a high chance of spoilers!! I won’t write about them in detail, but there will be references.$f$, 26994, 6, 6, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-17T09:22:55.745+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-17T09:22:55.784+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17573396, $f$HoneySong$f$, ARRAY[$f$TheWildJoker$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu's life is absolutely perfect, the perfect job, the perfect co-worker, the perfect boyfriend. The only problem lays with said boyfriends older brother, and how overly protective he is. Mo Xuanyu thought that he and Nie Mingjue had come to some sort of agreement, turns out he was wrong. Or Nie Mingjue needs to learn how to knock.This fic is dedicated to all the rare pairing shippers out there!$f$, 2921, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T11:55:02.884+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T11:55:02.917+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17591051, $f$By His Will and the Grace of Gods$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Fiacha mac Domnall's brother suddenly renounces the throne, the high priest is asked to leave behind his vows and take the crown to prevent a civil war. His new ally, the great knight people call Cenric the Wolf, just wanted to avoid bloodshed, but finds he sees more in his new king than just a capable ruler. Not everyone is happy to quietly relinquish their own claim to the kingdom, though, and so Fiacha and Cenric have more to grapple with than just their budding affection.$f$, 11349, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-02-17T01:11:09.705+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-17T01:11:09.808+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17595203, $f$The Lotus and the Dragonfly$f$, ARRAY[$f$mercyandmagic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wen Meishi was just a child when her brothers and father were killed during the Sunshot campaign. After years of hiding under an assumed name, she’s about to set her plan for vengeance into action. Lucky for her, it just so happens that Jiang Cheng is looking for a wife. Post-canon.$f$, 77794, 24, 24, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T11:54:20.784+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T11:54:20.806+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17602568, $f$Superego$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After a sensational kidnapping case one suspect is arrested and awaiting interrogation. The desperate police department consults a hypnotherapist who ensures them he'll get the criminal to confess within the next 24 hours.$f$, 6329, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-02-18T12:15:25.384+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-18T12:15:25.446+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17606225, $f$Grandmaster of Demonic Party Games$f$, ARRAY[$f$Trickster_Angel$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian has been interested in the paranormal for a while. And now he has the opportunity to experiment. Too bad Lan Wangji ruins it every time.$f$, 50978, 27, 27, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:24.117+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:24.137+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17606465, $f$Moment's Silence (Common Tongue)$f$, ARRAY[$f$etymologyplayground$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"What exactly does partying look like?"Shi Qing Xuan groans. "'What does partying look like,' he asks me," she laments. "Partying looks like drinking and dancing and having fun! You were a prince, you should know stuff like this.""I was a serious cultivator," Xie Lian counters. "You may have heard of me." Hua Cheng laughs. "And anyway I'm not allowed to drink.""Foolish Prince, Swordsman Poet, no rules, just right!" Shi Qing Xuan insists. "You can go back to being repressed tomorrow. But tonight who cares."--No rules just right! Just for one night, though.$f$, 14295, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-22T21:33:02.638+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T21:33:02.681+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17615129, $f$Some call it kidnapping. The Lan Clan call it adoption.$f$, ARRAY[$f$IceBreeze$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Lan Zhan, Lan Zhan, look!” Wei Ying did a twirl. “I’m the same as you now! Am I pretty? Say Lan Zhan, am I pretty?”
   
      Huan muffled a laugh behind his sleeve as A-Zhan said “Mn,” eyes never once leaving Wei Ying. There was something a little like awe in his stare, like Wei Ying was the only one in the world to him at that moment, and if Huan hadn’t already known that his little brother cared deeply for Wei Ying then that look would have been all the confirmation he needed.
   
      (If A-Zhan knew what marriage and romance was beyond the vague explanations he’d heard then he’d probably already be courting Wei Ying, with all the dogged determination he shows everything he puts his mind to. It’s adorable, and Huan supports it wholeheartedly, no matter what direction it heads in the end).  
Or: an AU Wei Wuxian is taken in by the Lan clan instead of the Jiangs.$f$, 16996, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:24:58.646+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:24:58.684+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17626031, $f$Butterfly in the Palm of a Bear's Hand$f$, ARRAY[$f$SugarAppleBlue$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The day Nie Mingjue visited the Koi Tower for a meeting with Jin Guangshan, Mo Xuanyu couldn’t help but to over hear their plans when he was walking by with an armful of books. Not only did Mo Xuanyu barge into the room, but he had spoken out of turn. After freely expressing how Nie Mingjue’s options didn’t seem concise and offering his own idea, it was only then that Mo Xuanyu realized he had stepped out of line. Before Jin Guangshan could stand, Nie Mingjue had held out a hand to stop him.
               After everything he heard about Nie Mingjue he had fully expected him to scold and berate him. But that didn’t happen. Instead, Nie Mingjue had turned to Jin Guangshan and requested to fetch Mo Xuanyu whenever he needed to. Mo Xuanyu was appointed a position as an advisor as sorts. It was clear Nie Mingjue valued Mo Xuanyu’s second opinion and the guts he had to speak so openly.$f$, 3646, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:53.777+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:53.798+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17632853, $f$A Great Age, Ending$f$, ARRAY[$f$Papapaldi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider recounts his downfall$f$, 7002, 4, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-06-29T18:13:51.413+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T18:13:51.500+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17633120, $f$Disrepute$f$, ARRAY[$f$Birdfluff$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There was a shift in their world brought on by Billie Lurk's choice to free the Outsider. The change provoked a strange feeling inside the ones touched by the void. Something is wrong."They look at you through the eye of a dead god. You will never be safe unless you take care of the source, first." -- Anonymous$f$, 24082, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-26T09:46:06.926+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-26T09:46:07.007+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17633729, $f$Clear and Grey$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Tirne would do anything, but to do nothing is a different matter.$f$, 893, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-02-15T12:27:02.884+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T12:27:03.007+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
