($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17730479, $f$In the Time of Molten Ice$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Queen Marigold has been deposed for the will to follow her heart when it comes to herself. Her knight Isadora is with her.$f$, 1146, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-02-15T12:41:39.628+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T12:41:39.711+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17732489, $f$what we learn from one another$f$, ARRAY[$f$softshark$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$TOLKIEN J. R. R. - Works & Related Fandoms$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“My most crucial lesson for you,” Finrod hmmmed, closing his eyes.... "Is that the most important thing in life is enjoyment. To do things because they spark joy, because they stimulate your mind and bring you pleasure."In which Finrod is a spoiled prince, and tries to impart the wisdom of leisure and simple hobbies on Balan, Balan thinks Finrod is a perfectly adequate enough hobby for him, and they both ponder the differences between their two races.$f$, 1620, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-30T11:58:30.357+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-30T11:58:30.388+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17733956, $f$It's who you are.$f$, ARRAY[$f$hypermoyashi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When the hand that helped him caught Xie Lian after he stumbled, he drew in a sharp breath. The ghost groom, or whatever stranger had deigned to take him on a bloody stroll in the dead of night through a haunted forest, smelled of maple and rain. It was cloyingly sweet and impossible to mistake.(AKA the one in which Xie Lian and Hua Cheng are both omega)$f$, 18202, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:49:06.612+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:49:06.638+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17734994, $f$I've Lost Her$f$, ARRAY[$f$multifanwho$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Valerie's internal thoughts having to watch Lucille fall for Cyril$f$, 683, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-01T20:31:54.233+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T20:31:54.235+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17736020, $f$Mountain Wine$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngshiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Shen Qingqiu felt like a chill wind was blowing down his robes. No matter how many plot holes he filled or improvements he made to the story, nothing could save him forever from the stallion novel’s shit foundation. He remembered this storyline. 
It was when Airplane Shooting Towards the Sky reached peak laziness.$f$, 5846, 2, 2, true, 0, true, $f$2019-02-28T23:21:33.493+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-28T23:21:34.028+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, $f$41845019$f$, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17737442, $f$please milk your boyfriend, Hua Cheng$f$, ARRAY[$f$silverprism$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng notices stains on his boyfriend’s clothes and he can’t resist to ask. He literally ends up milking Xie Lian.$f$, 1281, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:23:24.695+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:23:24.729+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17743826, $f$Two for the price of one$f$, ARRAY[$f$ULTIOcean$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Wei WuXian opened his eyes again in the world of the living, he didn't know what to expect. He hadn't asked to be brought back, had no intention return on his own, either. But he had, inhabiting a body that was not his own, drowning in memories and desires for revenge, a lonely soul asking for retribution, even if he'd been asking the wrong person.He had known he had to fulfill this person's wishes to be set free, and as such was the contract, he hadn't felt wronged or used, it was how things were, and the other person had paid the price for their wish. But...But nobody ever told him what to do in this situation? Whatever was he supposed to do with a toddler? And why did the spell take that person's last mumbled wish as a condition, too? How was he supposed to fulfill that, ah?Big blue eyes stared up at him.He stared back.He totally hadn't singed up for this!He was going to do it, because of course he was going to! He didn't want to die again so soon! If he had to become a single father and rise this child alone until he was happy, then so be it! Wei WuXian would shower him with all the love he had!$f$, 41744, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-31T12:09:35.926+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-31T12:09:35.945+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
