($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17753369, $f$she was everything to me, except mine$f$, ARRAY[$f$northernstars$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$You look… exactly like you.
It hurts. It hurts more than she ever thought it could. But Lucille smiles back at her, and somehow that makes it better and worse at the same time. Damn her.$f$, 2798, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-04T12:07:21.769+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-04T12:07:21.859+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17757572, $f$Caminos perdidos$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lunavap$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$El mundo ha cambiado, las grandes sectas ya no son lo que eran, los cultivadores se han vuelto ciegos y mediocres, ya no sueñan con la inmortalidad y el mundo entero se encuentra regido por la renacida y poderosa secta Wen. Los únicos que aun ven el mundo como antaño, solo pueden soñar con la libertad que todos les han negado. Sin embargo, la repentina desaparición de discípulos de distintas sectas trae el caos a este nuevo mundo, al mismo tiempo que un viajero llega desde tierras lejanas en busca de su desaparecido padre. Mientras explora las distintas sectas en su búsqueda, ira desentrañando los secretos del pasado que nadie quiere recordar.$f$, 698, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:09:08.971+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:09:09.008+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17758541, $f$Winter Witch and Spring Witch$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Two witches, in love. NSFW watercolor artwork.$f$, 0, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-02-16T01:48:59.083+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-16T01:48:59.086+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17758892, $f$The Lost Hero$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lady_1998$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"…il rito richiede una dose di sangue dell’officiante per permettere al suo obiettivo…ma non specifica se l’obiettivo debba essere una persona vivente o meno…Però… potrei far arrivare qui Wei Wuxian da qualsiasi posto si trovi…vivo o meno…c’è scritto che in base alla distanza, sarà richiesta una pari quantità di sangue…è rischioso, potrei morire se è troppo lontano…ma ero già disposto ad offrirgli il mio corpo. Questo partendo dal presupposto che si sia veramente reincarnato…e se non lo fosse? Rischierei la vita inutilmente? Se invece si fosse reincarnato, niente mi garantisce che accetti di aiutarmi. Qua non dice che la persona richiamata debba anche rispettare il desiderio di chi ha effettuato il rituale...dovrei pregarlo? Raccontargli tutto? Oppure..."Sentì dei rumori. I borbottii dei servi. Passi. La voce di suo cugino. "Quel dannato ha detto tutto alla mamma! Se crede di passarla liscia..."[What if...? E se il rituale di offerta del corpo fosse fallito perchè Wei Ying si era già reincarnato nel futuro?]$f$, 14902, 10, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:40.565+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:40.588+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17768066, $f$A Knight Until Morning$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"I have no desire to go to my wedding bed a virgin," the king had said, and Rolf, in a moment of great daring had opened his stupid gob to volunteer, as if the greenest recruit didn't know better than to ever volunteer for anything, and now here they were.$f$, 1137, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-02-15T12:12:28.281+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-15T12:12:28.350+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17769773, $f$Whats So Wrong With That?$f$, ARRAY[$f$salty_gay_prince$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Its modern day and life is one mess after another for Jiang Cheng. But things might actually not be as bad as he thinks, even when his secret is discovered by the last person he'd want to see him like that.In which JC is a Dom that gets to threaten and beat people for money! Story Will focus on JC, but there will be chapters with others as well. Multi pairingALL MY BOYS ARE ALIVE.AU.$f$, 9523, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T11:53:45.566+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T11:53:45.587+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17771930, $f$White blossom bathed on dew$f$, ARRAY[$f$BandagedRabbit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$‘’You’re drunk already, let me do the last ones, it will be half mine and half yours.’’ But of course the younger didn’t need the prize at all, he just wanted to help him to win, so he poured the liquor down his throat. Xie Lian pouted while denying that with his head and interrupting in the middle ‘’ It won’t because you’re drinking more than me.’’ Said that, he caught the cup on his hand and drank the liquid left on it. ‘’Now it’s half mine…and half yours.’’ Xie Lian smiled sheepishly.$f$, 5662, 2, 2, true, -1, true, $f$2019-10-22T21:42:13.651+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T21:42:13.661+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, $f$41934632$f$, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
