($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17778245, $f$Casting Out The Serpent$f$, ARRAY[$f$HerenorThereNearnorFar$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Balan-who-will-be-Bëor comes to some conclusions about his new friend after said new friend demonstrates a terrifying knowledge of venomous snakes. In conclusion, Finarfin was a reptile hoarder and also elves might be poisonous.$f$, 3688, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-31T03:34:01.518+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T03:34:01.759+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
