($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17799074, $f$Fair Play$f$, ARRAY[$f$reconditarmonia$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"I can hardly blame Madame d'E— if she does not wish to duel me herself, but how extraordinarily quaint and countrified that she should send a professional."$f$, 1793, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-23T03:00:30.685+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:00:31.163+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17801459, $f$1964$f$, ARRAY[$f$SoftPupcake$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$I'm not great with summery's but I'll try,Do Valerie and Lucille end up together or is there someone else out there for Valerie?$f$, 24880, 10, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-06-04T11:50:28.727+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-04T11:50:28.807+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17807333, $f$Come Alive$f$, ARRAY[$f$Shamelesscooper$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian lives for the moments before dawn, when the world is just waking up, when the silence of the night gives way to life and the darkness doesn’t feel quite so forbidding anymore. Somehow in the night, Hua Cheng had tucked himself into Xie Lian’s side, cramped comically into the space just under his armpit like a child. An arm had been thrown haphazardly over Xie Lian’s chest, and for once, he let himself lie under the grounding weight of it.Neither of them needed to breathe, not really, but beside him, Hua Cheng’s chest still rose and fell, as if they were just two young men rather than the fathomlessly old beings they both were. It was the only sound in the room for a long time, before slowly, like the coming of spring, droplets of rain began to shower down outside. Xie Lian sighed, languoring in the heaviness of his limbs in the dark pre-dawn. Here, now, no one needed him. He had no prayers to answer, no voices calling for his attention. It was nice.----Xie Lian and Hua Cheng wake up one morning at Puji Shrine. That's it. That's the fic.$f$, 2912, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-11T14:39:18.178+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T14:39:18.224+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17808605, $f$Watch For Me By The Moonlight$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A wounded stranger, a snowstorm, a homesteader, and more...$f$, 1738, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-02-18T12:21:35.277+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-18T12:21:35.340+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17830052, $f$Life Itself$f$, ARRAY[$f$SugarAppleBlue$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng shows up at his door after Xie Lian came back home from years of traveling the world after falling out with his family.$f$, 5246, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:41.852+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:41.878+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17841881, $f$Duet$f$, ARRAY[$f$lo_n_behold$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It’s taken a lot of compromise and sacrifice, but Lan Wangji and Wei Wuxian have managed to build a best friendship based on mutual trust, love, and understanding, and now that they’re roommates, they’re near inseparable. Lan Wangji does his best to retain some autonomy in a friendship bordering on codependency, because while he’d love to give even that for his beloved, he can’t let his pining destroy him. He can only cherish every moment he has Wei Wuxian at his side, all too aware that this bliss will eventually come to an end.And when Wei Wuxian is asked on a date by another man, Lan Wangji has to accept that that end is likely upon them.$f$, 43107, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:15.001+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:15.037+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17859368, $f$Unbreakable$f$, ARRAY[$f$Forgotten64$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$宝石の国 | Houseki no Kuni | Land of the Lustrous (Anime & Manga)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Cangse Sanren is famously known in the cultivation world for creating cultivators out of gemstones and minerals, known as Gems. These warriors are distributed among the sects to be guards or to aid the sects in times of struggle. Some famous Gems are the Twin Jades that were adopted by the Gusulan’s own sect leader as his sons. Another is the Core Melting Hand topaz of the Wen Sect. There’s also that red diamond that acts as her own guard, but the way she treats him looks more like a mother doting on her son.Houseki no Kuni AU$f$, 22402, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:50.258+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:50.294+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17864246, $f$the cold read$f$, ARRAY[$f$offlight$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A fake relationship for the sake of revenge had sounded like a good idea to Wanyin at the time.$f$, 12022, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:29.986+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:29.998+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
