($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17877590, $f$the wei to the kingdom (is through the prince's heart)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Bird_of_Dreams$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It was supposed to be a simple tournament held to celebrate the Kingdom of Gusu’s recent victory over the Wen Kingdom. Wei WuXian has no idea how it suddenly derailed into a free-for-all contest for Second Prince Lan WangJi’s hand in marriage.$f$, 4210, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:46:34.193+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:46:34.231+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17878757, $f$Xie Lian Sucks Some Tiddies$f$, ARRAY[$f$Epher$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng really likes the idea of Xie Lian getting him pregnant with his divine seed, and develops a phantom pregnancy. Xie Lian loves his dramatic San Lang so much.$f$, 4779, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:46:02.355+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:46:02.382+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17879567, $f$Adorned$f$, ARRAY[$f$whetherwoman$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There might be two or three words of this story that aren't unrelenting smut.$f$, 2885, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-04-28T00:04:29.224+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:04:29.227+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17894528, $f$good company$f$, ARRAY[$f$fiveandnocents$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Oliver & Company (1988)$f$, $f$Disney - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$She sighs, this full body thing that Dodger can feel, and says, “It’s not so bad, Dodge. We all thought it would happen eventually.”“Yeah? So I’m just the idiot then—not realizing the kid would end up in love with me?”$f$, 7768, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-08-17T22:52:39.142+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T22:52:39.209+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17897045, $f$the world's a little richer, just 'cause they came along$f$, ARRAY[$f$northernstars$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“When I prayed at night, I asked God for this, but I didn’t think...” She pauses, looking down. “He’s already so busy with the rest of the world. I never expected Him to listen.”“Wait,” Val places a finger under her chin so they she can look Lucille in the eye again, “You asked God? For me?”$f$, 1507, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-01T20:37:00.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T20:37:00.352+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17913614, $f$Brothers and Sisters$f$, ARRAY[$f$mercyandmagic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$On the eve of his wedding, Jīn Guāngyáo's sworn brothers seek him out for celebration. When they find him reeling from Madame Qín's revelation, a terrible confession - and a plea for help - emerges instead. Began as a one-shot and morphed into a behemoth of angst and (maybe) no one dying.$f$, 166135, 38, 38, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:13.407+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:13.427+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17916290, $f$Heartsong$f$, ARRAY[$f$Befallings$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$They met and they parted. Where speech fails, let your heartbeat be your song.$f$, 14395, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:08:14.507+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:08:14.533+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17927363, $f$A Shower of Golden Feathers$f$, ARRAY[$f$silverneko (silver_neko)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuan Yu's StoryA young master was taken into a new world of flying swords and things that can only be considered magical in the eyes of the common people.But the darkness lingers beneath the sparkling golden facade of luxuries and happiness that will surely test the body, mind and soul.Tags updated as we go. Will remind tag update for each chapter.$f$, 3859, 1, 6, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:32.424+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:32.444+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17954951, $f$Moby-Dicked$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Moby Dick - Herman Melville$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ishmael recounts a decidedly different version of the tale of Ahab’s first fateful encounter with the white whale.$f$, 1438, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-04-22T01:43:22.358+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T01:43:22.436+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17956415, $f$In the Darkness$f$, ARRAY[$f$ilcuoreardendo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The shrines to the Outsider smell of sea foam, brine, ocean dark secrets.$f$, 105, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:28:10.712+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:28:10.787+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17979059, $f$The Same as Us$f$, ARRAY[$f$Epher$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$”Today we witness the punishment of Lan Wangji of the Cloud District. Two nights ago he was discovered fornicating with another omega man, whom has yet to be found. The penalty is three hundred lashes. One hundred and fifty for himself and one hundred and fifty for his accomplice. Should the other man come forward, he may rightfully take his share of the punishment.”Xie Lian’s whole body shook. It took everything in Hua Cheng to refrain from embracing him, should they be tossed out into the arena themselves. That boy out there couldn’t be more than fifty, not even a real adult yet. He didn’t need to look in Xie Lian’s eyes to know what he was thinking. They had been fifty when they fell in love.-“So you’re looking for an alpha who fucks other alphas to marry your omega son?” Hua Cheng asked, perhaps a tad rude, “sounds a little off, don’t you think?”Qingheng-Jun paused, then spoke, “perhaps a union with someone who empathizes with his situation would be less unbearable. Someone who does not care if Wangji will never love them.”$f$, 9067, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:44:15.543+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:44:15.556+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17983184, $f$gasping at glimpses of gentle true spirit$f$, ARRAY[$f$northernstars$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Her life will never be the same after tomorrow. She might lose the part of her family she felt she could always rely on. But Lucille is beside her, will hold her hand throughout, and as long as she is, Valerie feels like she can take on the world. 
or, Valerie deals with her emotions after last weeks episode and Lucille never once stops loving her.$f$, 2664, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-23T03:01:10.564+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:01:10.964+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17985281, $f$And so, they feed everyone with dog food$f$, ARRAY[$f$Crystalline (EternalWitch)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$One day, Feng Xin and Mu Qing decided to pay Xie Lian a visit. But HuaLian being HuaLian, fed them with dog food instead. This is for Feb 26: Hugs prompt.$f$, 516, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:53:55.491+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:53:55.537+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17987846, $f$Fractured Harmony$f$, ARRAY[$f$SoonToBeCyborg$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 90634, 24, 24, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-30T17:55:55.041+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-30T17:55:55.142+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17991521, $f$a song you've never heard$f$, ARRAY[$f$arahir$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian is fatally injured, but Lan Wangji is nothing if not stubborn.
  “If I was gone, Hanguang-Jun, what would you do?”
  He asks it on a quiet morning at the end of summer, the hum and click of insects outside whispering into the Jingshi. It’s warm once the mist burns off the Recesses, and bright with dappled sunlight.
  Lan Wangji looks at him, brow pinched. “Nothing,” he says after a moment.
  It is, he discovers three months later, the first lie Lan Wangji has ever told.$f$, 4840, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-21T22:16:30.145+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T22:16:30.176+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17996159, $f$Little One$f$, ARRAY[$f$arcadenemesis$f$, $f$stardropdream$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Most would find it beneath their station to even consider travelling out. But not Hanguang-jun. Beneath a cold jade exterior, beat a heart warm and compassionate. For him, duty and love were not always so different. No matter how insignificant, he would always be there for those in need.
  Wei Wuxian never needed convincing when it came to Lan Wangji. It was more than the will of some greater force — Wei Wuxian would always long to be by his side in this second life. But before they had set out from Gusu, he had uttered a single sentence that only tempered his resolve further. 
  “It's taking the children.”
A visit to a village with a little corpse problem leads to a little more than Wei Wuxian or Lan Wangji bargained for.$f$, 8568, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-06T23:54:46.942+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-06T23:54:46.998+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 17997059, $f$Falcon Business$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Rivers of London - Ben Aaronovitch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Are you quite certain?” asked Nightingale, eyeing the remarkably iridescent orange liquid in the unremarkably ordinary pair of shot glasses with no small amount of caution.

  “No,” I replied, shrugging, “and that’s the entire point of the exercise, isn’t it?”$f$, 1413, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-04-22T02:07:57.655+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T02:07:57.790+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
