($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18032255, $f$chiaroscuro$f$, ARRAY[$f$lichti$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$For Hua Cheng, it was love at first sight.
And it was love at second sight, and third, and-
And it’s love every time his gaze falls upon Xie Lian, because then, just when he thinks it’s impossible to love this man more, Xie Lian smiles.
When he smiles, God when he smiles, it’s with the force of a thousand stars, and Hua Cheng just falls deeper and deeper.$f$, 2367, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:39:22.140+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:39:22.189+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
