($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18111086, $f$Take Me by the Waist to the Water$f$, ARRAY[$f$etymologyplayground$f$, $f$Bomzhechmo11$f$, $f$atomicmuffin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Ge ge, want to get married?" "... Aren't we already married?"--Instead of freezing, Xie Lian teases back. It Kills The Man$f$, 1905, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-20T16:12:21.977+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T16:12:22.011+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18118685, $f$Slave by Name, Master by Nature$f$, ARRAY[$f$87Tam_the_piemaker87$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Oropher takes the people of Laketown captive and in lieu of some ancient tradition, has them made into slaves. Thranduil abhors slavery but chooses Bard, who has no intention to respect his boundaries. In the mean time, our anxious Prince has to marry a king from another land, and struggles to put the good of his kingdom before his own selfish desires.$f$, 4657, 3, 3, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:22:00.837+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:22:00.860+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18123563, $f$this is why we can't have nice things$f$, ARRAY[$f$synonemous (sussiekitten)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In which Wei WuXian learns that he should listen to his friends more, especially when it comes to Lan WangJi’s feelings for him.$f$, 7284, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:01.296+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:01.322+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18126458, $f$no culture$f$, ARRAY[$f$Einhorn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He swallows once. Reasonably, he knows that nothing will go wrong. Months of careful discussion and planning tell him so; Hua Cheng had assured him that if he so wished, it would end in an instant, and he would be safe. Xie Lian forces down the anxiety, redirects his focus to the silk of the thin robe that he wears over his bare skin. He thinks about how much he wants this.
He wants it very, very much.$f$, 5634, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-11T14:37:50.648+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T14:37:50.691+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
