($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18137801, $f$Provocateur$f$, ARRAY[$f$linguamortua$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Punisher (TV 2017)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Frank discovers Billy’s secret, and drives himself crazy trying to figure out how to bring it up. (A story in which Frank Castle is very beefy and stupid.)$f$, 7175, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-04-05T11:16:12.120+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-05T11:16:12.590+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18139517, $f$Remedy of your Actions$f$, ARRAY[$f$Kaihaku$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Woah, holy shit! Wei Wuxian's YouTube channel and social media accounts have been deleted!"It's been only less than a day since the mass reporting against Wei Wuxian happened. For the first hour, the hashtag #WeiWuxianisOverParty started off with only 1k tweets, and then as hours pass it became the number 1 trending on every social media site, all of the posts spewing hate and relief that he's disappeared off the face of the internet. At the 20 hour mark even major news sources joined in and wrote articles about Wei Wuxian, from falsehoods to chronological events that led up to his YouTube channel being deleted and his social media accounts being suspended. The Yiling Patriarch, Wei Wuxian, has died.__________________________________Mo Dao Zhu Shi/Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation but everything's the same except it's a Youtuber/Corporation AU and almost everyone lives.$f$, 7061, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:45:38.196+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:45:38.216+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18154787, $f$straw; meet back$f$, ARRAY[$f$synonemous (sussiekitten)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The day Mo XuanYu snapped. Or how Wei WuXian realised he's in love.$f$, 13092, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:56.383+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:56:56.405+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18165953, $f$GHOST CHILD SUN$f$, ARRAY[$f$AngelaVargas$f$, $f$AngeloVargas$f$, $f$FongLian$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Dying is One Thing... Transmigrating to someone else’s body is another and Wei WuXian knew this. But the Question is... Why Fate must Put His Soul into the Body of a Megalomaniac that is Wen RuoHan? Where’s that Bastard anyways...The Answer is Simple... The Guardian Whose Name is AnJie Luo Fucked Up the Transmigration somehow...And there’s no turning back... Well... Might as well have some fun...I'm giving you guys a Choice...$f$, 29650, 7, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:33:05.617+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:33:05.646+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18179294, $f$the ghost king's bride$f$, ARRAY[$f$arahir$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ghosts won't stop giving Xie Lian flowers, Hua Cheng won't stop teasing, and Xie Lian is out here doing his best, man.
  Xie Lian is momentarily frozen. Outside of heaven, no one calls him Highness except in jest, and there was a time people threw flowers at his feet as if to make a carpet for him to walk upon, but those years are long past. “Thank you. This is a—a princely gift.” 
  The spirit’s black-pit eyes go wide and then he grins, revealing long, wicked teeth the color of tarnished silver. “Yes! Yes, I knew it was meant for his Highness.” The spirit nods to Hua Cheng, too, whose grin has widened to something almost obscene.
  “Truly,” Hua Cheng agrees.$f$, 9738, 2, 2, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-21T15:06:26.275+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T15:06:26.432+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18182333, $f$Paper$f$, ARRAY[$f$Vaiqrusa$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Have you been obsessed to dead with the rarities of your own mind?$f$, 593, 9, 9, true, -1, false, $f$2019-04-26T09:43:05.386+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-26T09:43:05.424+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18187883, $f$Wolf in Sheeps Clothing$f$, ARRAY[$f$SomethingReallyWeird$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After Jin Guangyao is dead Nie Huaisang thinks of Mo Xuanyu. How he'd met the boy, how he fell in love with him, how he used him to avenge his brother.$f$, 1533, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-30T15:23:16.767+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T15:23:16.813+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18228413, $f$The Three-Body Problem$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Liu Qingge gets hit by demonic sex pollen, it's up to Shen Qingqiu and Luo Binghe to save him.$f$, 3911, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-04-23T12:55:09.832+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-23T12:55:09.882+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18229445, $f$Pain Is What Makes Us People$f$, ARRAY[$f$Arakyune$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“A-Ling, do you know what this reads?”Jin Ling shook his head and his uncle sighed.“This one here reads Yuan, and this one,” he stopped for a moment before looking Jin Ling in the eyes and continued, “it reads Wen.”---------Jin Ling has two soulmates, but what does it matter if both of them are Wens, and probably already dead.$f$, 3177, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:43:17.298+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:43:17.328+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[])
